+// RUN: mlir-opt -allow-unregistered-dialect %s | mlir-opt -allow-unregistered-dialect | FileCheck %s
+
+// Builtin arrays and dictionaries nested in one another are parsed, printed and
+// visited for aliases from an explicit stack. The text round-trips, a nested
+// value with an alias prints as its alias, and a unit entry prints its name.
+
+// CHECK: #[[MAP:.*]] = affine_map<(d0) -> (d0)>
